{"title":"2000 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>A number is placed in the box to make the following statement true: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/4/c24454ebba726cc793b902073ef11221d8f3083c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8+\\frac{7}{\\square}+\\frac{3}{1000} =8.073.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"184\" height=\"38\" /> What is this number? \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/1/08196e4d2b41d7c0a2dcbcf6fbc2adea94582ba3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 1000 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 100 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 1 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 10 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 70$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"452\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)\" title=\"2000 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)\">2000 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems\" title=\"2000 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2000 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2000 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2000 CEMC Gaus